b. Right-Angled Triangle Pattern

<?php

for ($i = 1; $i <= 5; $i++) {

    for ($j = 1; $j <= $i; $j++) {
        echo "* ";
    }

    echo "<br>";
}

?>

Output:

*
* *
* * *
* * * *
* * * * *

